     "title": "A short exchange"
    },
    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "remember",
     "title": "Replies",
     "items": [
      "**Mabuti.** or **Mabuti naman.** means fine.",
      "**Mabuti rin.** means fine, too.",
      "**Salamat** (thank you) is optional. Po can be added again when you say it."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "h",
     "t": "Greetings that are really questions"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "Filipinos often greet each other by asking where you are going or where you have been. This is a friendly hello, **not** a request for your plans."
    },
    {
